      <div style="padding:20px;background:oklch(0.19 0.014 260);border:1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.08);border-radius:10px;">
        <div class="mono" style="font-size:12px;color:oklch(0.78 0.13 195);margin-bottom:6px;">determinism is a feature</div>
        <p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:oklch(0.68 0.01 260);margin:0;">Time and identifiers come from services, so a decision — including its trace and duration — is reproducible under test.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

