        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:oklch(0.72 0.01 260);margin:0 0 20px;">Roles form a directed acyclic graph. A role inherits every permission reachable below it — <span class="mono" style="color:oklch(0.85 0.006 260);">flattenPermissions</span> resolves the closure, <span class="mono" style="color:oklch(0.85 0.006 260);">resolveRoleGraph</span> rejects cycles at construction.</p>
